    "content": "The 2026 NCAA Tournament First Four, held in Dayton, Ohio (March 17–18), features eight teams competing to fill the final spots in the 64-team bracket. The matchups include low-seeded conference champions and the last at-large bids, with key games including No. 16 Howard vs. No. 16 UMBC, No. 11 Texas vs. No. 11 NC State, Prairie View A&M vs. Lehigh, and Miami (Ohio) vs. SMU. 2026 Men's First Four Matchups (Dayton, OH): Tuesday, March 17: Howard 86, UMBC 83. Tuesday, March 17: Texas 30, NC State 25 (Halftime score/live update). Wednesday, March 18: Prairie View A&M vs. Lehigh. Wednesday, March 18: Miami (Ohio) vs. SMU. 2026 Women's First Four Matchups: Wednesday, March 18: Nebraska vs. Richmond. Wednesday, March 18: Missouri State vs. Stephen F. Austin. Thursday, March 19: Southern vs. Samford. Thursday, March 19: Virginia vs. Arizona State. The First Four acts as the official opening round of March Madness, with winners advancing to the first round of the main tournament.",
